{'symbol': 'CINF', 'date': '2021-05-10 09:04:00', 'title': 'CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'CINCINNATI, MAY 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CINF) ANNOUNCED THAT AT ITS REGULAR MEETING ON MAY 8, 2021, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A 63-CENTS-PER-SHARE REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND. THE\xa0DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JULY 15, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JUNE 17, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'CINF', 'date': '2021-05-10 09:02:00', 'title': "CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION HOLDS SHAREHOLDERS' AND DIRECTORS' MEETINGS", 'text': "CINCINNATI, MAY 10,2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CINF) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT BASED ON PRELIMINARY VOTING RESULTS AT THE COMPANY'S ANNUAL MEETING ON MAY 8, 2021, SHAREHOLDERS ELECTED ALL DIRECTORS FOR ONE-YEAR TERMS TO THE 14-MEMBER BOARD. SHAREHOLDERS ALSO APPROVED A NONBINDING RESOLUTION TO APPROVE THE COMPENSATION FOR THE COMPANY'S NAMED EXECUTIVE OFFICERS AND RATIFIED THE SELECTION OF DELOITTE & TOUCHE LLP AS INDEPENDENT REGISTERED PUBLIC ACCOUNTING FIRM FOR 2021."}{'symbol': 'CINF', 'date': '2021-05-10 09:04:00', 'title': 'CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'CINCINNATI, MAY 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CINF) ANNOUNCED THAT AT ITS REGULAR MEETING ON MAY 8, 2021, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A 63-CENTS-PER-SHARE REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND. THE\xa0DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JULY 15, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JUNE 17, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'CINF', 'date': '2021-05-10 09:02:00', 'title': "CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION HOLDS SHAREHOLDERS' AND DIRECTORS' MEETINGS", 'text': "CINCINNATI, MAY 10,2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CINF) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT BASED ON PRELIMINARY VOTING RESULTS AT THE COMPANY'S ANNUAL MEETING ON MAY 8, 2021, SHAREHOLDERS ELECTED ALL DIRECTORS FOR ONE-YEAR TERMS TO THE 14-MEMBER BOARD. 